    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Hamster Funland!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a world of adorable hamsters and endless fun! &quot;Hamster Funland&quot; is a charming match-2 puzzle game inspired by the classic Pikachu game. Match tiles, customize your hamsters, and build the playground!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa2 Your Hamster Playground</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add fun attractions like slides, ball pits, and spinning wheels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407170/extras/7499d835e9031a503f418a6d45ddc91c.avif?t=1735911609\" data-has-big width=800 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc39 Adorable Hamster </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock and choose from a variety of lovable hamsters, each with unique outfits and styles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407170/extras/ae1d113e9924d379ef3f70184493313b.avif?t=1735911609\" data-has-big width=800 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Classic Match-2 Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Match pairs of cute hamster-themed tiles to clear levels and earn rewards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome unique challenges like locked tiles, time-limited stages, and tricky obstacles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407170/extras/daee08d52762c0be1b20dda5c2f5e036.avif?t=1735911609\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 Music Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy cheerful in-game music or upload your favorite songs to play while you match and build!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d Flexible Viewing Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore your hamster paradise from any angle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whether you\u2019re a puzzle lover or a hamster enthusiast, &quot;Hamster Funland&quot; has something for everyone. Start matching, customizing, and creating your dream hamster world today!</strong></p>",
